        "text": "End-game scoring (spec/systems/scoring.md func_03A9C0). base = population (+1 criminal/servant/convert, +2 free colonist, +4 specialist) + 5*founding_fathers + rebel sentiment - razed*(1+diff). difficulty multiplier = diff+4 +1@diff>=3 +1@diff>=4 = {4,5,6,8,10}. score=(mult*base)/100, halved. ScoreGame computes the live score; the breakdown shows via %NUMBER0=score, %NUMBER1=difficulty multiplier."
